lifepath_name_gdmerchant = Golden Deep Merchant
lifepath_description_gdmerchant = You are a self-owned and operating merchant hailing from the illustrious Golden Deep merchant collective, you are a player in the Great Game and enjoy its benefits back home.

lifepath_name_grandmerchant = Grand Merchant
lifepath_description_grandmerchant = You are a Grand Merchant of the Golden Deep. You are the best of the best, you own businesses and push progress in your collective. You operate at the very highest level of the Golden Deep and The Great Game.

lifepath_name_gdthesian = Thesian
lifepath_description_gdthesian = You are one of the lower tier citizens of the Golden Deep. You live quite a normal life, own your own property, and decide your own fate. You do not take part in the Great Game as others do, and cannot own your own business, but are quite comfortable where you are now.

